<title>USA: Allen Parish SD 25, La., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Allen Parish SD 25, La., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co., said it won $3.500 million of Allen Parish SD 25, La., general obligation school bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.1959 percent.</p>
</text>
